urces) transmembrane currents of the","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,139.61,572.57,149.61],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e98218500d045582e","kind":"glyph","char":"neurons, and neuron models used to compute an LFP signal must thus have a minimum of two","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,152.6,575.83,162.6],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ec824d766b72eb81e","kind":"glyph","char":"spatially separated compartments in order to generate a potential [32]. In LIF models, however,","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,165.58,575.99,175.58],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ed5ae02b8d78345f1","kind":"glyph","char":"a single compartment is typically used as an approximation of the entire neuron, including the","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,178.62,572.45,188.62],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4a87cf32a48b9f92","kind":"glyph","char":"spatially extended dendritic structure, and individual cells within a population are not assigned","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,191.6,574.68,201.6],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ec5cf8a4d7f680da9","kind":"glyph","char":"to a specific spatial position.","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,204.59,311.14,214.59],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e35dfcec707467eef","kind":"glyph","char":"One possible way to compute LFPs from LIF network is to project the spike times generated","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[211.97,217.62,574.27,227.62],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e19ea88060edf660f","kind":"glyph","char":"by the LIF network under consideration onto morphologically detailed 3D neuron models and","font":"AdvOT1ef757c0","bbox":[200.01,230.61,572.85,2